# Current-State Azure Architecture Assessment

## Management Groups

Current State:
Azure subscriptions have grown organically and require
reorganization around enterprise workload boundaries.

Observed Risks:
- Inconsistent policy inheritance
- Subscription-level policy duplication
- Unclear platform/workload boundaries
- Difficult enterprise-wide control enforcement

Target Capability:
Enterprise management-group hierarchy supporting platform,
production, non-production, sandbox, and transitional workloads.